* #SBDL-004385-0 "Yo'g'on ichak amyabiazi, distal, chap tomonlama, subtotal, total jarohatlanishi. Asorati: qon ketish, postgemorragik anemiya I-II-III-darajasi, psevdopolipoz, ichak strikturasi. Konservativ davo. Ikki og'izli yoki bir og'izli ileostoma yoki kolostoma qo'yish"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Амебиаз толстой кишки, дистальный, левосторонний, субтотальный, тотальный. Осложнения: кровотечение, постгеморрагическая анемия I-II-III степени, псевдополипоз, кишечная стриктура. Консервативное лечение. Наложение илеостомы или колостомы с двумя или одним отверстием."
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Amebiasis of the colon, distal, left-sided, subtotal, total. Complications: bleeding, posthemorrhagic anemia grade I-II-III, pseudopolyposis, intestinal stricture. Conservative treatment. Double- or single-barrel ileostomy or colostomy."
  * ^property[0].code = #icd10
  * ^property[=].valueString = "A06.1"
  * ^property[+].code = #direction
  * ^property[=].valueString = "Koloproktologiya yo'nalishi"
  * ^property[+].code = #section
  * ^property[=].valueString = "Yo'g'on ichak amyabiazi"
  * ^property[+].code = #variant
  * ^property[=].valueString = "0.1"
  * ^property[+].code = #performerLevel
  * ^property[=].valueString = "A"
  * ^property[+].code = #effectiveFrom
  * ^property[=].valueDateTime = "2025-09-19"
* #SBDL-004386-6 "Yo'g'on ichak amyabiazi, distal, chap tomonlama, subtotal, total jarohatlanishi. Asorati: qon ketish, postgemorragik anemiya I-II-III-darajasi, psevdopolipoz, ichak strikturasi. Konservativ davo. Ikki og'izli yoki bir og'izli ileostoma yoki kolostoma qo'yish, total kolektomiya ileo-rektal anastamoz qo'yish, total kolproktektomiya bir og'izli ileostoma qo'yish. Total kolektomiya, to'g'ri ichak cho'ltog'ini hosil kilish, bir og'izli ileostoma qo'yish"
